.TH "QTERMINATOR" "1" "2026-04-14" "QTerminator 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qterminator \- Qt terminal emulator with splits, tabs, and plugin system
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qterminator
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBQTerminator\fR is a Qt port of the Terminator terminal emulator,
built with PyQt6 and QTermWidget. It allows arranging multiple
terminal panes in tabs and splits, with broadcast input, layout
persistence, and an extensible Python plugin system.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Window options
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show summary of options and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show the QTerminator version and exit.
.TP
\fB\-T\fR, \fB\-\-title\fR=\fITITLE\fR
Specify a title for the window.
.TP
\fB\-\-geometry\fR=\fIWxH[+X+Y]\fR
Set the window geometry. Width and height are required;
position offsets are optional. Example: \fI1024x768+100+50\fR.
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-M\fR, \fB\-\-maximise\fR, \fB\-\-maximize\fR
Start with a maximised window.
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-fullscreen\fR
Start with a fullscreen window.
.TP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-borderless\fR
Render the window without borders or decorations.
.TP
\fB\-H\fR, \fB\-\-hidden\fR
Hide the window at startup.
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-role\fR=\fIROLE\fR
Set a custom WM_WINDOW_ROLE property on the window.
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-icon\fR=\fIPATH\fR
Set a custom window icon (path to image file).
.SS Terminal options
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-working\-directory\fR=\fIDIR\fR
Set the initial working directory for the terminal.
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-command\fR=\fICOMMAND\fR
Specify a single command string to execute inside the terminal.
.TP
\fB\-x\fR, \fB\-\-execute\fR \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR...]
Use the rest of the command line as a command to execute,
along with its arguments.
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-profile\fR=\fIPROFILE\fR
Use the named profile as the default for new terminals.
.SS Layout options
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-layout\fR=\fILAYOUT\fR
Launch with the named saved layout.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-restore\fR
Do not restore the previous session layout.
.SS Information
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-profiles\fR
List all configured profiles and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-layouts\fR
List all saved layouts and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-new\-tab\fR
Open a new tab in the running QTerminator instance (if supported).
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.SS Tabs
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+T\fR
New tab.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+W\fR
Close current terminal.
.TP
\fBCtrl+PgUp\fR / \fBCtrl+PgDn\fR
Previous / next tab.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+PgUp\fR / \fBCtrl+Shift+PgDn\fR
Move tab left / right.
.TP
\fBAlt+1\fR..\fBAlt+9\fR
Switch to tab N.
.SS Splits
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+O\fR
Split horizontally.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+E\fR
Split vertically.
.TP
\fBAlt+Left\fR / \fBAlt+Right\fR / \fBAlt+Up\fR / \fBAlt+Down\fR
Navigate between split panes.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+Left\fR / \fBRight\fR / \fBUp\fR / \fBDown\fR
Resize current split.
.TP
\fBMeta+R\fR
Rotate splits.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+Z\fR
Maximize / unmaximize current pane.
.SS View
.TP
\fBF11\fR
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+M\fR
Toggle menu bar.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+=\fR / \fBCtrl+Shift+\-\fR / \fBCtrl+0\fR
Zoom in / out / reset.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+S\fR
Toggle scrollbar.
.TP
\fBShift+PgUp\fR / \fBShift+PgDn\fR
Scrollback up / down.
.SS Edit
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+C\fR / \fBCtrl+Shift+V\fR
Copy / paste.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+F\fR
Search.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+R\fR
Reset terminal.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+G\fR
Reset and clear.
.SS Terminal
.TP
\fBCtrl+Alt+X\fR / \fBCtrl+Alt+A\fR / \fBCtrl+Alt+W\fR
Edit terminal / tab / window title.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Alt+N\fR / \fBCtrl+Alt+P\fR
Next / previous profile.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/qterminator/config.toml\fR
User configuration file. Sections include
\fI[general]\fR, \fI[profiles.\fIname\fR]\fR,
\fI[keybindings]\fR, \fI[layouts]\fR, and
\fI[plugins.\fIname\fR]\fR.
.TP
\fI~/.config/qterminator/plugins/\fR
User plugin directory. Python files placed here are loaded
automatically. Each plugin must subclass one of \fIPlugin\fR,
\fIURLHandler\fR, \fIMenuProvider\fR, or \fIOutputWatcher\fR
from the \fIqterminator.plugin\fR module.
.TP
\fI~/.config/qterminator/color\-schemes/\fR
User color scheme directory. \fI.colorscheme\fR files placed
here override built-in schemes from \fI/usr/share/qtermwidget6/color\-schemes/\fR.
.SH PLUGINS
.PP
QTerminator ships with a number of built-in plugins:
.TP
\fBurl_handlers\fR
Detects HTTP/HTTPS, file://, and email addresses in terminal output.
.TP
\fBissue_tracker\fR
Matches configurable PREFIX-NUMBER patterns (e.g., QTERM-1234)
and opens them as URLs.
.TP
\fBcustom_commands\fR
Sends configured shell commands from the context menu.
.TP
\fBlogger\fR
Logs terminal output to a file.
.TP
\fBscreenshot\fR
Save the visible terminal area or full buffer as a PNG.
.TP
\fBpdf_export\fR
Export the visible area or full scrollback to a styled PDF.
.TP
\fBprint_terminal\fR
Print the terminal contents via QPrintDialog.
.TP
\fBbuffer_export\fR
Export to HTML, plain text; copy with HTML/Markdown formatting.
.TP
\fBtext_transforms\fR
Context menu transforms on selected text: base64, JSON pretty-print,
URL encode/decode, hex-to-ASCII, hashes, case conversions, etc.
.TP
\fBpattern_links\fR
Open IP addresses, file paths, stack traces, UUIDs, Docker container
IDs, and git hashes from the terminal.
.TP
\fBoutput_monitors\fR
Watch output for errors, build progress, log levels, and sensitive
data; update the terminal title bar accordingly.
.TP
\fBnotifications\fR
Flash the terminal when configured patterns appear or when the
foreground process becomes idle.
.TP
\fBprocess_control\fR
Send signals (SIGSTOP, SIGCONT, SIGTERM, SIGKILL) to the foreground
process from the context menu.
.TP
\fBfile_monitor\fR
Notify when files in the working directory stop being modified.
.TP
\fBscheduler\fR
Schedule text to be sent to the terminal after a delay,
optionally repeating.
.TP
\fBmodal\fR
Vim-like modal keybindings (\fICtrl+[\fR for normal mode).
.TP
\fBstacked_panes\fR
Show one terminal at a time in a tab; cycle through hidden panes.
.TP
\fBworkspace_switcher\fR
Fuzzy-find and open project workspaces in new tabs.
.TP
\fBtmux_integration\fR
Optionally start terminals inside tmux for persistent sessions.
.TP
\fBsmart_clipboard\fR
Smart paste/copy operations (escaped paste, paste as single line,
copy without ANSI colors).
.TP
\fBdim_backgrounds\fR
Suppress bright background colors in dark themes.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBSHELL\fR
The shell program to launch in new terminals. Defaults to
\fI/bin/bash\fR if not set.
.TP
\fBQT_QPA_PLATFORM\fR
Set to \fIoffscreen\fR for headless test execution.
